### Task Management API — Users (Admin / Manager)

@contentType = {{contentType}}

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### List users (users:view) — paged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?pageNumber=1&pageSize=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@userId = {{login.response.body.$.user.id}}

### Get one user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a user (users:manage)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Admin",
  "lastName": "User",
  "isActive": true
}

### Assign a role (users:manage) — role: Viewer|Developer|Manager|Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "role": "Admin" }

### Deactivate a user (soft delete). You cannot delete your own account (409).
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
